# IDE and build artifacts
.vs/
bin/
obj/
TestResults/
# Playwright traces and screenshots that a failed browser test leaves behind (Portfolio.E2E).
Portfolio.E2E/artifacts/
native/build/
# The documented CMake commands write to <repo>/build/native/<kernel>, not native/build/.
build/

# Local environment & secrets.
# appsettings.json is committed as the secret-free base config (ArcGis base URL and
# defaults) so a fresh clone runs; real secrets go in appsettings.Development.json or
# environment variables and stay untracked.
.env
Portfolio.Web/appsettings.Development.json
DataProtection-Keys/

# Real cluster secret; k8s/secret.example.yaml is the committed template.
k8s/secret.yaml
*.user

# Agent tooling and agent-facing documents stay on the owner's disk and out of git.
# Claude Code: project config (launch.json etc.) and every agent worktree (each is its own checkout).
.claude/
**/CLAUDE.md
**/CLAUDE.local.md
# Documents written for agents: context, prompts, cleanup plans and findings, implementation plans.
.github/copilot-instructions.md
docs/agent-context.md
docs/cleanup-prompt.md
docs/cleanup/
docs/plans/

# Only the root README.md is tracked; every other README.md (native/, k8s/, css/, ...) stays local.
**/README.md
!/README.md
